youtube client

needs mpv and yt-dlp. signs in with your browser's youtube cookies, which
yt-dlp reads out each time ytv starts: safari on macos, firefox elsewhere.
`ytv chrome` (or firefox, brave, firefox:<profile>, anything yt-dlp's
--cookies-from-browser takes) switches browser and remembers it.

safari keeps its cookies behind macos privacy settings: give your terminal
Full Disk Access in System Settings › Privacy & Security.
